        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Cover woven with a silk warp and a linen weft. The warp is striped in green, white, yellow, purple and pink and the ground is woven in satin, and set against the striped ground is a floral design in reverse satin. Backed with pink silk and edged with yellow braid. No complete repeat of the design in the width."@en , "Cover woven with a silk warp and a linen weft, Italy, 18th century"@en ;
